      "CPU and GPU deltas do not establish a material regression on the measured NVIDIA Turing system",
      "the clean Chrome feature matrix proves disabled features do not retain their Passes, owned resources, history, readbacks, counter copies, or extra submits"
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "the formal comparison covers one NVIDIA Turing adapter and is not a cross-vendor performance claim",
      "triangle setup, Surface ABI, and tile-backend gates remain insufficient-evidence",
      "these measurements do not prove the product-level 1920x1080 at 60 FPS target"
